      "insight": "Readers aren't clicking ETF coverage for yield or product mechanics — they're tracking the SEC as a political actor, reading regulatory approval as a legitimacy verdict that determines whether institutional capital flows to Bitcoin, Ethereum, or gets cut off at altcoins entirely.",
